description:
Prigotovtes k nezabyvaemomu priklyucheniyu! Pered vami samoe polnoe izdanie poluchivshey mnozhestvo nagrad rolevoy igry Persona 5 Royal, kotoroe soderzhit prosto more zagruzhaemogo kontenta!

Glavnyy geroy — starsheklassnik, kotoryy byl vynuzhden pereekhat v Tokio i perevestis v odnu iz gorodskikh shkol. Vskore posle etogo on vidit strannyy son: tainstvennyy golos nazyvaet ego uznikom sudby i soobshchaet, chto v nedalekom budushchem yunoshu ozhidaet katastrofa. Teper, chtoby proyti nekiy kurs «reabilitatsii», on dolzhen spasat lyudey ot ikh sobstvennykh porochnykh zhelaniy, primeriv masku Prizrachnogo pokhititelya.

Glavnye osobennosti:
– issleduyte Tokio, obustraivayte logovo Pokhititeley, otkryvayte novykh person i razblokiruyte alternativnye kontsovki;
– v polnom izdanii Personal 5 Royal vy mozhete stat luchshim Prizrachnym pokhititelem i brosit vyzov obshcheprinyatym normam, otkryv v sebe skrytuyu silu i srazhayas za spravedlivost;
– Soderzhit bolee 40 predmetov iz vypushchennogo ranee zagruzhaemogo kontenta;
– dostupno ozvuchenie na yaponskom i angliyskom yazyke.

Srazites s nimi v odinochku ili s tremya druzyami v lokalnom kooperativnom rezhime – pust oni uslyshat vash boevoy klich: Bogam mesto v adu!

V God Slayers vy stanete chlenom odnogo iz Ordena chernoknizhnikov. Na etot raz vy stolknetes s gorazdo bolshey ugrozoy, chem v originalnoy igre. Unichtozhiv ordy tenevykh monstrov, chernoknizhniki razozlili bogov, i teper oni vragi. Vy mozhete libo sdatsya, poprosit poshchady i besslavno umeret, potomu chto slovo "poshchada" neizvestno Temnym Bogam. Libo vy mozhete raskryt svoi bogopodobnye sily i zastavit bogov zaplatit za predatelstvo.

No znayte, chto oni ne sdadutsya bez boya i natravyat na vas vsevozmozhnykh zabavnykh na vid pikselnykh protivnikov. Ne dayte sebya obmanut i pomnite, chto eti nelepye sushchestva obladayut vsemi neobkhodimymi navykami, chtoby vas pobedit. S pomoshchyu ogromnykh bossov oni ispytayut vas na prochnost. Srazhaytes ili pogibnite. Tretego ne dano.

V Warlocks 2: God Slayers vy naydete:
● Umoritelnaya pikselnaya grafika s ruchnoy prorisovkoy animatsii;
● Dinamichnye massovye srazheniya v odinochnom i lokalnom kooperativnom rezhime;
● Svyshe 40 tipov kovarnykh vragov s unikalnymi naborami navykov, kotorye mogut obedinitsya protiv vas;
● Prostornye karty s mnozhestvom sluchayno generiruemoy dobychi dlya sbora;
● 5 tipov chernoknizhnikov, kazhdyy so svoimi sposobnostyami, kotorye razblokiruyutsya po khodu igry;
● 8-10 chasov priklyucheniy s odnim chernoknizhnikom;
● Raznoobraznye silnye i ogromnye bossy, kotorye tolko i zhdut, chtoby ikh unichtozhili.

"Unichtozhay gadin i nabivay ogromnye kombo, chtoby zarabotat dragotsennye tochilnye kamni v etoy populyarnoy ekshen-golovolomke ot Capybara Games.  Unikalnyy geympley Grindstone s sostavleniem tsvetov legko osvoit, odnako, chtoby zapoluchit samye krutye kamni tebe ponadobyatsya um, strategiya i muzhestvo. Obmenivay svoi tochilnye kamni na novenkoe snaryazhenie, chtoby preodolet kovarnykh vragov i zhutkikh bossov, pokorit bolee 200 urovney na gore Grindstone i pokazat svoyo masterstvo, zanyav pervoe mesto v ezhednevno obnovlyaemoy tablitse liderov.

Osobennosti:
- zubodrobitelnye boi i golovolomki;
- bolee 200 urovney;
- ezhednevnye ispytaniya s tablitsami liderov;
- desyatki vidov oruzhiya i snaryazheniya;
- otmechennyy nagradami saundtrek Sema Vebstera."

Idyot 1984 god. Mira, kakim my ego znali ranshe, bolshe net. Chudovishchnaya rukotvornaya epidemiya poglotila vse prezhnie formy zhizni, i na ikh mesto prishlo nechto novoe, chuzherodnoe i uzhasayushchee. Mutanty, eto zlo, vyrvavsheesya iz yashchika Pandory i vobravshee v sebya inoplanetnye geny, nepodvlastny lyudyam. Konets chelovechestva uzhe blizok!

Doktor Khartmut Grisgram, nadlomlennyy gorem ekstsentrichnyy uchenyy, otvetstvennyy za sozdanie sinteticheskikh lyudey, zapuskaet svoyu proklyatuyu chelovecheskuyu fabriku v posledniy raz. Teper dlya togo, chtoby vypustit na svet svoyo zaklyuchitelnoe, velichayshee tvorenie i poslednyuyu nadezhdu — bezuprechnuyu mashinu unichtozheniya, boevoy prototip SturmFront.

Vam predstoit sygrat v roli Zigfrida fon Khammershtayna, unikalnogo poluorganicheskogo boevogo prototipa s edinstvennoy tselyu sushchestvovaniya — seyat smert i razrushenie.

- szhigayte mutantov dotla svoim ognemetom;
- nakhodite skrytye dushi, chtoby vyyasnit pravdu o voyne s mutantami i ikh proiskhozhdenii;
- istreblyayte gigantskikh tvarey bez zhalosti i somneniy;
- klassicheskaya arkada s privkusom svintsa i tyazhelogo metalla.

I Am The Hero — eto nostalgicheskoe pochitanie retro-geyminga iz razmytykh detskikh vospominaniy razrabotchika, pripravlennoe yarostnoy strastyu k igram-valilkam. Esli ty ishchesh nastoyashchuyu sovremennuyu interpretatsiyu klassicheskoy igry, nastal chas ispytat sudbu i otvetit na prostoy vopros: «geroy li ty?»

Poluchay udovolstvie ot dinamichnoy igry s retro-ekshenom, sozdannoy pod vpechatleniem sovremennoy shkoly i klassiki. V igre I Am The Hero ty naydesh dozu nostalgii i adrenalina, kotoruyu tak dolgo iskal.

Chego zhe ty zhdesh? Probil chas bitvy!

KhARAKTERISTIKI:
 * igrovaya kampaniya dlya odnogo igroka;
 * lokalnaya multi-igra;
 * dinamichnaya i uvlekatelnaya bitva;
 * Free Style Combos: davi, oblaposhivay, nabrasyvaysya i beri svoikh vragov v plen svoimi unikalnymi stilyami borby;
 * Critical Blink: esli tochno rasschitat vremya ataki, ty mozhesh nanesti ogromnyy uron svoim protivnikam s pomoshchyu Critical Blink.

Ey, na palube! Zemlya Uuu opustilas pod vodu, i Finn s Dzheykom dolzhny vyyasnit, pochemu eto proizoshlo.  Issleduy vmeste s nashimi geroyami opasnye vody, ishchi podskazki, rassprashivay piratov i srazhaysya so zlodeyami, chtoby otkryt etu zhutkuyu taynu i spasti mir!

• Issleduy Zemlyu Uuu, idi kuda khochesh, raskryvay sekrety i sobiray dobychu vmeste s zabavnymi personazhami Finnom, Dzheykom, BiMO i Marselinoy;
• Podnimay parus, puteshestvuy po moryu mezhdu korolevstvami i doberis do nevedomykh zemel, chtoby uznat, chto zhe voobshche proiskhodit;
• Povyshay uroven geroev, ispolzuy predmety, zaklinaniya, zelya i uboynye umeniya, chtoby pobezhdat negodyaev v bystrykh takticheskikh boyakh;

V etom priklyuchenii s nasyshchennym syuzhetom vy s kazhdoy uspeshnoy vylazkoy uznayote novoe ob Imperii... i o sebe.

Glavnye osobennosti:
— issledovanie kosmosa v protsedurno sgenerirovannoy vselennoy;
— takticheskie bitvy mezhdu korablyami i eskadrilyami;
— bolee 300 vozmozhnykh syuzhetnykh sobytiy;
— glubokiy i dramatichnyy syuzhet v 6 glavakh;
— mrachnaya i gnetushchaya atmosfera v dukhe nashikh lyubimykh nauchno-fantasticheskikh vselennykh

Run like there's gnome tomorrow!
Join Bumb, Berzerk, and Speedster as they run, jump, fly, glide and break their way through the magical lands of Gnomia to reach their mysterious destiny.
You can help them save the kingdom, find a princess and collect hundreds of precious lost socks.

Key Features:
● beat one of the most challenging “runners” ever published;
● put your skills to the test in over 80 levels (and more to come!);
● overcome daring obstacles hidden deep in the castles;
● prove yourself a hero by saving the princess.

Are you ready to dash into the gnomish world of Geki Yaba Runner?

Davnym-davno, v dalyokoy-predalyokoy strane Zloy Drakon vzyal v plen vsekh korolevskikh naslednikov, kotorykh tolko mog vstretit. Mnozhestvo dostoynykh kavalerov iz kazhdogo korolevstva pytalis protivostoyat chudovishchu, no bezuspeshno. Nastal vash cheryod! Vam predstoit sdelat vsyo vozmozhnoe, chtoby proyti podzemele, odolet drakona i organizovat samoe idealnoe svidanie!



Proydite cherez priklyuchenie v postoyanno menyayushchemsya zamke s 3 protsedurno-generiruemymi oblastyami;

Broste vyzov obitatelyam zamka, ispolzuya sluchaynye kachestva vashego rytsarya;

Pered svoim «i zhili oni dolgo i schastlivo», vam predstoit zavoevat serdtse printsessy ili printsa! Pozovite ikh na idealnoe SVIDANIE i srazites so Zlym Drakonom vmeste so svoey vtoroy polovinkoy!

Ispolzuyte oshibki svoikh predshestvennikov s pomoshchyu sistemy uluchsheniy, polzuyas opytom, poluchennym s predydushchimi avantyuristami!

Naslazhdaytes potryasayushchim vizualnym stilem, khranyashchim dukh klassicheskikh igr o podzemelyakh, no prevrashchyonnym v vesyoluyu parodiyu na multfilmy!

Speed Brawl — dvukhmernye boevye sostyazaniya dlya vsekh, kto umeet bystro begat i krepko bit! Ne sbavlyayte temp, narashchivayte serii udarov i ispolzuyte uboynye spetspriemy. Pridumayte svoy boevoy stil i sozdayte luchshuyu komandu potasovshchikov v mire. A potom povtorite vse eto bystree… bystree… EShchE BYSTREE!

Osobennosti
– 6 unikalnykh potasovshchikov so svoim stilem igry;
– kucha uluchsheniy dlya kazhdogo boytsa, ne ostavlyayushchikh nikakikh shansov sopernikam;
– velikolepnaya grafika i prekrasnaya animatsiya personazhey;
– bolee 50 napryazhennykh zabegov v neskolkikh chempionatakh «Skorostnoy potasovki»;
– sovmestnoe prokhozhdenie vsey kampanii na odnom ekrane ili po seti!

Syuzhet
London, 1888 god. Posle desyatiletney voyny Britanskaya imperiya nakonets-to razgromila nasekomoobraznykh lunnykh zakhvatchikov, zhukov-selenitov, blagodarya podvigu khrabrogo ofitsera Khyugo Uellsa. On razdavil korolevu zhukov i stal ne tolko geroem imperii, no i, po suti, novym povelitelem selenitov.

Posle voyny selenity stali novoy dvizhushchey siloy nashey promyshlennoy revolyutsii, ikh staraniyami my vstupili v novuyu eru progressa i protsvetaniya. Sbrosiv okovy truda, lyudi mogli nakonets zanyatsya bolee priyatnymi delami. Odnako len i nepovinovenie vskore okhvatili rabochikh i sredniy klass. Narod zhazhdal zrelishch, i Khyugo Uells pridumal idealnoe razvlechenie — elitnyy vid sporta, gde samye smelye, samye bystrye, samye dostoynye voiny istreblyayut ordy poraboshchennykh selenitov. Dobro pozhalovat… na «Skorostnuyu potasovku»!

«Ne stolko khorror, skolko igra ob idee khorrora», — Rock Paper Shotgun
«„Tuk-tuk-tuk“ — eto potryasayushche krasivyy survival-khorror, gde stilya bolshe, chem zdravogo smysla», — IGN
«Odna iz uvlekatelneyshikh i ocharovatelneyshikh igr, chto popadalas mne v poslednee vremya», — GameFront

***

Vot uzh trete pokolenie Zhiltsov obitaet v malenkom lesnom domike. No s nedavnikh por zdes tvoritsya chyort-te chto: steny budto vzdymayutsya, vo tme kto-to vorchit, a s cherdaka donositsya dikovatyy voy. Neuzhto bessonnitsa Zhiltsa dovela ego do gallyutsinatsiy? A mozhet, on vsyo zhe natknulsya na svidetelstva nekoy mrachnoy tayny?

Poslednie luchi zakata gasnut, i v igru vstupayut koshmarnye tvari.

Proderzhites do utra, lataya svoy obsharpannyy domik, i ne pozvolte Zhiltsu okonchatelno kanut v puchinakh bezumiya. Pryachtes ot prichudlivykh Gostey, chto pytayutsya k vam probratsya, i ishchite razgadku, kotoraya pozvolit Zhiltsu dobratsya do finala.

Osobennosti:
— igra pro vyzhivanie i bezumie;
— pryachtes ot prichudlivykh Gostey, chto vtorgayutsya v vash domik;
— chinite svet i latayte obstanovku komnat — eto uberezhyot vas ot opasnykh tvarey;
— proderzhites do utra, ne poteryav rassudok;
— uznayte, v chyom zagadka koshmarov Zhiltsa;

V igre 112 Operator mozhno upravlyat sluzhbami spaseniya po vsemu miru. Koordiniruyte rabotu spasateley, prinimayte vyzovy i spravlyaytes s ekstrennymi situatsiyami, vyzvannymi nepogodoy, transportom i sezonnymi izmeneniyami. Pomogayte gorodu spravlyatsya s sereznymi opasnostyami, takimi kak bunty, organizovannaya prestupnost, terroristicheskie ataki, prirodnye kataklizmy i mnogoe drugoe!

V rezhime karery vam predstoit vybrat odin iz evropeyskikh gorodov i proyti ves karernyy put dispetchera v sluzhbe spaseniya. Ispolnyayte prikazy nachalstva i nablyudayte, kak vashi deystviya otrazhayutsya na podchinennykh i na tekh, komu vy pomogaete. Byvaet, chto za oshibku vas vsego lish otchitayut v pisme, no inogda ona mozhet stoit i zhizni.

Osnovnye osobennosti: 

- shirokiy nabor unikalnykh ekstrennykh vyzovov i krupnykh proisshestviy;
- rezhim kampanii s sistemoy tseley, elektronnoy perepiskoy i syuzhetom;
- smena vremeni sutok, pogody, sezonov i dorozhnoy obstanovki — vsyo eto teper vliyaet na khod sobytiy i spasatelnykh rabot;
- rasprostranyayushchiesya pozhary mogut unichtozhat regiony tselikom, i na borbu s nimi nuzhny desyatki otryadov;
- regionalnaya spetsifika: teper igra zavisit ot mestnogo zakonodatelstva i tipa mestnosti (trushchoby, delovoy tsentr, spalnyy rayon, promzona, les i ne tolko);
- vizualizatsiya obstanovki: tochnaya i intuitivno ponyatnaya kartina proiskhodyashchego;
- raznoobrazie v komande: vrachi, serzhanty, sobaki, roboty i ne tolko!
- vspomogatelnye dispetchery, kotorykh mozhno naznachat dlya pomoshchi razlichnym rayonam;
- pravdopodobnye instruktsii po okazaniyu pervoy pomoshchi.

V mire, gde igra v vyshibaly — eto tselaya zhizn, vam nuzhno igrat za Otto, kotoryy uchitsya v akademii i khochet stat velichayshim chempionom vyshibal. V igre vosem glav, v khode kotorykh nuzhno sobrat luchshuyu sportivnuyu komandu, poputno nazhivaya i druzey, i vragov.

Dlya povysheniya urovnya Otto i razvitiya komandy est masshtabnaya sistema, kotoruyu mozhno nastraivat pod sebya. Takzhe vam predstoit issledovat obshirnuyu Akademiyu vyshibal i uznat davnie sekrety, tayashchiesya v stenakh, gde vy zhivyote, uchites i pobezhdaete.

V igre:

— Akademiya vyshibal s bolshim kampusom, polnym samoy raznoy zhizni i tayn;
— polnotsennyy rolevoy syuzhet s glavami, osnovnymi i vtorostepennymi zadaniyami i shkolnymi miniigrami;
— unikalnye personazhi i rolevaya sistema razvitiya dlya sostavleniya raznoobraznoy komandy;
— dinamichnye matchi s groznymi vragami i bossami i unikalnyy boevoy stil;
— sorevnovatelnyy rezhim po lokalnoy seti dlya matchey s druzyami.

forma.8 — unikalnaya variatsiya na temu priklyuchencheskogo boevika v zhanre Metroidvania s vpechatlyayushchey grafikoy i ogromnym mirom, kotoryy mozhno issledovat. Vash igrovoy personazh — nebolshoy issledovatelskiy zond forma.8, okazavshiysya v polnom odinochestve na poverkhnosti dalekoy planety. Poteryav svyaz s tovarishchami v rezultate neschastnogo sluchaya, vam nuzhno vyzhit — nayti i vosstanovit poteryannyy moshchnyy istochnik energii, poka ne stalo slishkom pozdno. Vas zhdut drevnie tsivilizatsii, sereznye opasnosti i mrachnye videniya. Ne vse yavlyaetsya tem, chem kazhetsya...

- issleduyte ogromnyy otkrytyy mir, polnyy tayn;
- razgadyvayte drevnie tayny;
- poluchayte novye usileniya, chtoby proyti dalshe v svoem priklyuchenii;
- srazhaytes so smertonosnymi vragami i moguchimi bossami;
- pogruzites v mir glubokikh i zagadochnykh predaniy;
- krasivaya risovannaya vektornaya grafika s komfortnoy chastotoy 60 kadrov v sekundu.

Vy gotovy otkryt taynu?

MX vs ATV All Out — neveroyatnoe priklyuchenie!

Vyberite avto: bayki, metovezdekhody, vnedorozhniki... naydite svoy stil igry i vpered — kolesit po miru!


Vozmozhnosti:   
— igrayte s drugom na 1 ekrane v 8 rezhimakh;
— sostyazaytes;
— igrayte v rezhime «fristayl»;
— prevratite lichnuyu kollektsiyu v predmet dlya zavisti;
— prokachivayte mashiny;
— vodite, kak vam khochetsya, i sorevnuytes s professionalami.

Mr. Prepper is about being prepared. You know something is wrong. The risk of a nuclear war is in the air and you need to get ready for what's coming. Struggle for your freedom and deal with the authoritarian government in this survival crafting game.

Features: 
- Build an underground shelter;
- Craft machines and facilities that can keep you alive: farms, greenhouses, tools, vehicles, etc.;
- Trade with neighbours, give them what they need, get what is useful to you;
- Explore atmospheric locations ad scavenge materials and items you could use;
- Make a plan – something radical needs to be done;
- Meet other rebellious characters, complete quests for them and help each other in the opposition to the regime;
- Outsmart the secret police – they don't want you to be prepared, they want you to stay controlled.

Mr. Prepper is a guy living in a country which once had been the land of the free, but its new government has changed everything. Obey, stay in your lane, and love the President – otherwise, the secretive and all-powerful Agency will take interest in you. Mr. Prepper has decided to defy this and get out of this delusion of life. The only way for him to hide his plans and doings is to build an underground shelter and construct a machine that will help him get out. But for that, he will need materials, time, and secrecy. Help him succeed and break the status quo.

Evil Defenders – eto zabavnaya i neveroyatno uvlekatelnaya igra v zhanre tower defense: stroyte i uluchshayte bashni, otbivaytes ot nazoylivykh vragov pri pomoshchi magii, ispolzuyte unikalnye Mesta Sily i zashchishchayte Zemli Zla ot zakhvatchikov! 
Evil Defenders predlagaet igroku beschislennye sposoby prokhozhdeniya kazhdogo urovnya, v tom chisle, blagodarya raznoobraznym uluchsheniyam bashen i prodvinutomu derevu umeniy. Tselaya sotnya igrovykh dostizheniy pomozhet otsenit svoy uspekh!

- 90 urovney i 15 unikalnykh mestnostey dlya vypolneniya missiy;
- Mnozhestvo uluchsheniy i 60 bashen s raznymi kharakteristikami: Staraya Kripta, Goblin-Arbaletchik, Povelitel Yadov, Vasilisk i mnogie drugie;
- Pyat regionov: Nagore, Pustynya, Studenyy kray, Ostrov i Inferno; 
- Shest urovney slozhnosti, vklyuchaya rezhim «Ispytanie», dlya sovershenstvovaniya taktiki;
- Altar Vetrov, Yadovitoe Boloto, Sunduk Sokrovishch i drugie unikalnye osobennosti kazhdoy lokatsii;
- Prodvinutoe derevo umeniy dlya povysheniya vashikh vozmozhnostey zashchity;
- 100 igrovykh dostizheniy;
- Bogatyy geympley, krasivaya grafika i ochen atmosfernyy originalnyy saundtrek!

The Red Lantern – syuzhetnaya igra o vyzhivanii v stile rogue-lite, v kotoroy vy s komandoy iz 5 ezdovykh sobak okazhetes v glushi Alyaski i postaraetes nayti put domoy, po doroge perezhiv mnozhestvo udivitelnykh sobytiy.

Osobennosti:
- dinamicheskiy mir, menyayushchiysya po khodu igry;
- pochti 100 sobytiy s raznymi vozmozhnymi iskhodami;
- vozmozhnost uznavat mir vokrug i poluchat za eto predmety i uluchsheniya;
- 8 raznykh sobak dlya vashey komandy, kazhdaya so svoim kharakterom.

Catlateral Damage: Remeowstered — svezhee izdanie vashego lyubimogo simulyatora koshek-vrediteley, gde nuzhno igrat za domashnyuyu koshku i delat vse, chto nenavidit khozyain!

Vzglyanite na mir glazami koshki! Begayte po domu, oprokidyvayte stopki knig, beyte vazy, myaukayte bez prichiny, rvite shtory, spite v ukrytiyakh i uchinyayte prochie bezobraziya!

Vypolnyayte zadaniya, issleduyte dinamicheski generiruemye urovni ili prosto otdykhayte v lotke, zavodite vse novykh kotodruzey i obretayte novye sposobnosti!

Versiya Remeowstered sdelana zanovo s nulya, sokhraniv geympley originala i pridav igre novyy uluchshennyy vid.

Uluchsheniya i novovvedeniya:
• polnostyu pererabotano prokhozhdenie;
• dobavleny oprokidyvaemye i interaktivnye predmety;
• bolee 20 novykh fotografiy pitomtsa, itogo pochti 300;
• novye zadaniya;
• postoyannye povysheniya parametrov i sposobnosti;
• uluchsheny modeli i animatsiya koshek;
• uluchshen interfeys, animatsiya i effekty.

"Undungeon — eto action-RPG, kotoraya sochetaet v sebe dukh staroy shkoly i svezhiy, sovremennyy dizayn. Vosstanovite poryadok vo vsekh izmereniyakh, izmenite sudby mirov, sozdayte i napishite istoriyu novoy Multivselennoy.

Yarkiy i priyatnyy glazu piksel-art: kazhdoe derevo, kust i kamen narisovany ot ruki, a vragi tshchatelno i raznoobrazno animirovany. Vse eto sozdaet unikalnyy vizualnyy komponent igry;

Kompleksnaya nauchno-fantasticheskaya istoriya: neskolko versiy Zemli, sushchestvovavshikh v raznykh izmereniyakh, vnezapno okazalis v odnom, stolknuvshis i unichtozhiv drug druga. Etu katastrofu narekli Velikiy sdvig. Kataklizm povredil sami materii prostranstva i vremeni — kazalos by, bezvozvratno.
Vy vozmete na sebya rol Vestnika i prisoedinites k taynoy mezhprostranstvennoy organizatsii pod nazvaniem Taynaya Bukhta Vestnikov (ili poprostu Khab), sozdannoy Dkharmoy dlya ispravleniya posledstviy katastrofy;

Ozhivlennye boi v realnom vremeni: upravlyayte Vestnikom — mogushchestvennym geroem, poyavivshimsya na svet blagodarya bozhestvu. Kombiniruyte ego dalnie i blizhnie ataki, chtoby unichtozhat svoikh vragov. Polzuytes aptechkami ostorozhno, chtoby ikh ne ukrali vragi, ispolzuyte peredvizhenie i raznoobraznye baffy i debaffy, chtoby poluchit preimushchestvo v boyu i odolet protivnikov;

Nastroyka personazha: vzhivlyayte v telo Vestnika razlichnye organy, dayushchie unikalnye passivnye sposobnosti i usileniya boevykh navykov. Sobirayte i nadevayte runy i uzly, kotorye pozvolyat Vestniku stat podobnym bogam. Proyavite svoyu individualnost, sozdavaya personazha, polnostyu sootvetstvuyushchego vashemu igrovomu stilyu, bud to upor na kompanonov, metatelnoe oruzhie, kriticheskiy ili dlitelnyy uron i mnogoe drugoe;

Sozdanie predmetov: prorabotannaya sistema krafta pozvolit vam razbirat bazovye materialy i ispolzovat poluchennye resursy dlya sozdaniya unikalnykh organov, oruzhiya, ekipirovki i raskhodnikov, nezamenimykh dlya polucheniya deystvitelno unikalnogo opyta prokhozhdeniya igry.

Zagadochnaya smert devyati russkikh puteshestvennikov, kotoraya privela k beschislennym, nepodtverzhdennym gipotezam. Igrok pogruzitsya v beskraynie peyzazhi negostepriimnogo Urala s zadachey vyyasnit, chto zhe na samom dele proizoshlo. V khode sobytiy vy mozhete stolknutsya s bolshim kolichestvom spekulyatsiy, chem ozhidalos...

Osobennosti:
* rasskazano Shonom Binom;
* opyt pogruzheniya v issledovaniya;
* ledyanaya atmosfera i napryazhenie;
* samodelnaya istoriya, vdokhnovlennaya istinnymi sobytiyami;
* nelineynyy otkrytyy mir;
* vnutriigrovaya navigatsiya po karte i kompasu;
* rabotaet na Unreal Engine 4;
* slozhnye issledovaniya;
* raschetnaya prodolzhitelnost igry: 4–6 ch

Akane is a brutal arena arcade slasher based on one-hit-one-kill gameplay mechanics where you will:

Face five types of opponents:

● Yakuza Guy - a common mafia pawn;
● Tank - this is the only villain that will require more than just one katana slash to die;
● Shooter - a sharpshooter with cybernetic enhancements. Pro tip: they never miss;
● Cyber Ninja - a warrior who abdicated his body to become a killing machine. His dash attacks are deadly and his defense seems impenetrable. Remember however that everybody has their weak point;
● The Boss - Katsuro, your Nemesis who evolves, gets stronger and more dangerous according to the number of times he gets killed.

Complete missions to unlock new guns and equipment:

● Different pistols;
● Katanas, each with their own unique unique abilities;
● Cigarettes that change the aesthetics of your special skills;
● Gadgets that grant small but significant improvements in combat;
● Boots that change the dash and the way you move on the screen.

Make a good use of your special Samurai Skills:

● Dragon Slash - dash forward killing every enemy on your way;
● Dragon Slayer - kill all enemies on the screen.

Lightning Rod Games predstavlyaet A Fold Apart: otmechennuyu nagradami igru-golovolomku, kotoraya rasskazyvaet o slozhnostyakh otnosheniy na rasstoyanii — v bumazhnom mire!

Osnovnye osobennosti: 
– zastavlyayushchaya soperezhivat zhiznennaya istoriya otnosheniy na rasstoyanii; 
– svyshe 50 sozdannykh vruchnuyu bumazhnykh golovolomok; 
– krasivaya trekhmernaya grafika, pomogayushchaya pogruzitsya v uyutnyy bumazhnyy mir; 
– vozmozhnost vybrat paru, kotoraya pokhozha na vas bolshe vsego!

Dvoe vlyublennykh, prepodavatel i arkhitektor, vynuzhdeny razluchitsya, chtoby postroit kareru, no oni klyanutsya, chto rasstoyanie — ne pregrada dlya ikh otnosheniy. Posmotrite na etu istoriyu glazami geroev, kotorye pytayutsya spravitsya s trudnostyami i vzaimnym neponimaniem, i perezhivite vmeste s nimi vse emotsionalnye vzlety i padeniya, vyzvannye razlukoy. Perevorachivaya, sgibaya i razgibaya bumagu, reshayte golovolomki v sozdannykh vruchnuyu mirakh i pomogite vlyublennym preodolet vse voznikayushchie na ikh puti pregrady — smogut li oni sokhranit svoyu lyubov?..

V dannoy igre vy vystupaete v roli naemnika, kotoromu bylo porucheno otyskat propavshego cheloveka. Odin iz Arkhimagov Akademii, provodivshiy svoi issledovaniya v glubine Zarazhennoy Territorii, perestal vykhodit na svyaz. V svoe vremya dannaya oblast byla podvergnuta vozdeystviyu chudovishchnogo kolichestva magii i teper zapolnena porozhdeniyami Bezdny. Otpravlyaytes po sledam propavshego Arkhimaga i okunites v atmosferu priklyucheniya, polnogo magii i opasnostey!

V etoy igre vy:
- issleduete starinnye ruiny, tainstvennye peshchery i pokinutye doma;
- srazhaetes s magicheskim sushchestvami;
- sobiraete predmety i ispolzuyte ikh dlya resheniya golovolomok;
- sozdaete alkhimicheskie zelya iz naydennykh magicheskikh rasteniy;
- dolzhny otkryt prokhod mezhdu mirami i otyskat legendarnyy artefakt!

Vot i nachalas razrushitelnaya bitva kolossalnykh chudovishch! Etot kooperativnyy sayd-skroller v stile beat-’em-up sozdan po motivam mangi Kaydzyu i podkhodit dlya odnogo ili dvukh igrokov. Na Zemlyu vtorglis gigantskie sozdaniya — nefilimy, i ostanovit ikh mozhet tolko DAWN (Defense Alliance Worldwide Network — Globalnaya set oboronitelnogo soyuza). U etoy organizatsii svoi ispolinskie chudovishcha, kotorym ne strashny ordy vragov! Vam podvlastny chetyre svirepykh bakhamuta: Megadon, Egida Praym, Burya Galakhad i Ganira, i u kazhdogo unikalnye sposobnosti i boevye stili. Lomayte vsyo na svoem puti i vypolnyayte missii — a ikh bolee 35! Uluchshayte chudovishch s pomoshchyu DNK-tekhnologiy i sokrushayte vragov yarostnymi, zhestokimi udarami! Sudba Zemli teper zavisit tolko ot vas… No sumeete li vy predotvratit rassvet monstrov i gibel chelovechestva?

Otlichitelnye osobennosti igry:
- chetyre neobyknovennykh igrovykh personazha: Megadon, Ganira, Egida Praym i Burya Galakhad;
- effektnoe srazhenie monstrov i ekshen v dukhe beat-’em-up, dlya odnogo ili dvukh igrokov;
- goroda, kotorye mozhno razrushit do osnovaniya, ochen pokhozhie na nastoyashchie;
- yarostnye ataki, smertonosnye udary i bezzhalostnye zavershayushchie priemy;
- neistovye bossy i desyatki vidov vragov;
- DNK-tekhnologii dlya uluchsheniya monstrov!

Stavki ultravysoki, napryazhenie na maksimume… Nanesite protivniku ultramaksimalnoe porazhenie! Predstavlyaem igru iz populyarnoy lineyki Persona 4: vas zhdet neobychnaya zakhvatyvayushchaya istoriya i uvlekatelnye bitvy. Pomogite geroyam odolet armiyu teney na turnire P-1 Climax!


Glavnye osobennosti:
– versiya Ultimax so vsemi ranee vypushchennymi materialami Persona 4 Arena Ultimax, vklyuchaya originalnyy syuzhet igry Persona 4 Arena;
– mnozhestvo igrovykh personazhey: kak polyubivshiesya igrokam geroi iz Persona 3, tak i ikh tenevye dvoyniki vladeyut raznymi boevymi stilyami i umeniyami;
– yaponskaya i angliyskaya versii ozvucheniya.

Dobro pozhalovat v samyy zakhvatyvayushchiy i realistichnyy simulyator korablya — Ship Simulator! Peremeshchaytes na svoem korable po realistichnoy i podrobnoy otkrytoy karte mira.

V Ship Simulator est vse, chto vam bylo nuzhno v simulyatore korablya. V igre bolee desyatka realistichnykh i podrobno prorabotannykh korabley, a samoe priyatnoe — po suti vy poluchaete 3 raznykh simulyatora v odnom: simulyator kruiznogo laynera, simulyator gruzovogo korablya i realistichnyy simulyator neftyanogo tankera!

Dopolnitelnye vozmozhnosti nashego simulyatora:

• 3 razlichnykh klassa sudov: passazhirskie, gruzovye i neftyanye tankery;
• mnozhestvo korabley;
• vozmozhnost svobodno peredvigatsya po karte mira;
• udivitelnaya pogoda i tsikl dnya i nochi;
• potryasayushchaya grafika dlya mobilnogo simulyatora korablya;
• realistichnye otrazheniya v vode;
• neskolko variantov upravleniya;
• neskolko variantov nastroyki: menyayte tekst, tsvet i flag.

Etherborn — eto elegantnyy ekzemplyar platformera-golovolomki na mestnosti, osnovannyy na ponimanii struktur s izmenchivoy gravitatsiey.

V etom mire deystvuyut drugie zakony fiziki, i vashemu voobrazheniyu predstoit bolshoe ispytanie. Gravitatsiya napravlena perpendikulyarno k poverkhnosti, na kotoroy vy stoite, – privykayte k etomu i otpravlyaytes issledovat vozmozhnosti lokatsiy, napolnennykh navigatsionnymi golovolomkami.

Puteshestvuyte po zhivopisnym ekzoticheskim peyzazham, gde kazhdyy uroven – eto organicheskaya zagadka, kotoruyu snachala nuzhno issledovat, a zatem izmenit gravitatsiyu, chtoby prolozhit sebe put vpered.

Vy — besslovesnoe sushchestvo, tolko chto rozhdennoe v mire, gde bestelesnyy golos zhdal vashego poyavleniya. Kak tolko u vas voznikayut pervye mysli, vy ponimaete, chto vashe puteshestvie uzhe nachalos. Vy dolzhny nayti vladeltsa golosa, chtoby postich smysl svoego sushchestvovaniya.

Osobennosti:
• platformer-issledovanie s izmenchivoy gravitatsiey;
• navigatsionnye golovolomki, osnovannye na individualnom oshchushchenii gravitatsii;
• syurrealisticheskie urovni v atmosfere, vdokhnovlennoy sovremennym iskusstvom;
• dinamichnyy i zavorazhivayushchiy originalnyy saundtrek dlya kazhdogo urovnya.

Igra Etherborn dostupna na sleduyushchikh yazykakh: angliyskiy (audio i tekst), ispanskiy (audio i tekst), katalanskiy (audio i tekst), nemetskiy (tekst), frantsuzskiy (tekst), italyanskiy (tekst), russkiy (tekst), yaponskiy (tekst), uproshchennyy kitayskiy (tekst) i koreyskiy (tekst).

Vam predstoit igrat za odnorukuyu zhenshchinu-voina Sashu, prorubayushchuyu put skvoz koshmarnyy mir v poiskakh semi. Vas zhdut golovolomki, sekrety i ordy uzhasnykh monstrov. V stranstviyakh vy raskroete novye sposobnosti, razvivayas po kanonam RPG, i uznaete tayny mrachnogo mira, v kotoryy popala Sasha.

• Srazhaytes v podzemelyakh, sovershenstvuya boevye navyki;

• rubite vragov, ispolzuyte chasti ikh tel, chtoby stat silnee;

• issleduyte mir, reshayte golovolomki;

• i naslazhdaytes prekrasnoy muzykoy!


*Rezhim TV ne podderzhivaetsya.*

80'S OVERDRIVE is a 2D pixel art racing game, designed to take you back in time to when 8 and 16 bit consoles and arcade games ruled the world. Compete against opponents in career mode to unlock new races, buy new cars, and upgrade them with state-of-the-art technologies! Try your skill in time attack mode and see how far you can get in this race against the clock! Create your own tracks with built-in track generator and easily share them with your friends!

Features:
- 2 game modes and racing track editor;
- 6 retro supercars;
- 8 unique visual themes;
- 18 synth/retrowave music scores;
- tons of retro, handcrafted, pixel-perfect joy!

Puskay veselaya animatsiya ne vvodit v zabluzhdenie, legko ne budet. Ved khoroshiy agent RGB dolzhen obladat kuchey talantov.
Spy Chameleon — eto arkada-golovolomka, gde igrok dolzhen ostatsya nezamechennym, ispolzuya sposobnosti khameleona izmenyat tsvet i maskirovatsya.
Na protyazhenii 5 missiy i 75 urovney igrok vstretit raznykh vragov i raskroet novye sposobnosti, neobkhodimye dlya uspeshnogo zaversheniya etikh sverkhsekretnykh missiy. Vot lish para primerov: sdelat fotografiyu zvezdy s ee vozlyublennym i ukrast sekretnyy retsept populyarnogo bezalkogolnogo napitka.
Nablyuday za vragami, ishchi luchshiy put i begi k ocherednomu bezopasnomu mestu. Mozhno poigrat neskolko minut ili zhe potratit chasy na vypolnenie missiy i ispytaniy, pytayas stat luchshim po vremeni ili zarabatyvaya dostizheniya. 
Osobennosti igry:
- sposobnost izmenyat tsvet, chtoby maskirovatsya na mestnosti;
- 75 urovney s povyshayushcheysya slozhnostyu i rasshiryayushchimisya vozmozhnostyami;
- 3 dopolnitelnykh ispytaniya na kazhdom urovne (kollektsionirovanie i ogranichenie po vremeni);
- igrovoy protsess skladyvaetsya iz reagirovaniya, soglasovaniya deystviy i razrabotki strategii (na 60 kadrakh v sekundu v  1080p razreshenii);
- vozmozhnost sravnit svoi dostizheniya s rezultatami druzey i igrokov so vsego mira.

Faraday Protocol — eto golovolomka ot pervogo litsa, gde vam predstoit ispytat svoy um, soobrazitelnost i kriticheskoe myshlenie. V roli Rauga Zikona, kosmicheskogo arkheologa s planety Kunor, vy otpravites issledovat tainstvennyy signal, poluchennyy s neizvestnoy zvezdy.

Na OSOP vam vstrechaetsya pervaya tayna — bia-orudie, drevnyaya relikviya inoplanetnoy tsivilizatsii. Istinnoe prednaznachenie ustroystva neizvestno, no ono pomogaet vam prokhodit ispytaniya. Primenyaya ego sposobnost pogloshchat i pereraspredelyat energiyu v raznykh mekhanizmakh, vy vsyo dalshe i dalshe pogruzhaetes v sistemu. Golovolomki stanovyatsya vsyo slozhnee. Pomozhet li vasha smekalka i umenie reshat zadachi proyti vam vse ispytaniya do kontsa?

Vas soprovozhdaet tainstvennyy mekhanicheskiy golos. Eto AYRIS, iskusstvennyy intellekt, sozdannyy dlya zashchity sistem OSOP. Kazhetsya, etot kompleks byl vekami zabroshen, no dlya chego ego sozdavali? Zdes mnozhestvo golovolomok, kotorye stanovyatsya vsyo slozhnee i izoshchryonnee po mere prokhozhdeniya. Kto ikh soorudil? Zachem ponadobilos stroit trenirovochnyy kompleks na zabroshennoy planete?

Osobennosti:
razgadyvayte golovolomki i issleduyte tainstvennuyu kosmicheskuyu stantsiyu OSOP;

ispolzuyte bia-orudie, chtoby pogloshchat i pereraspredelyat energiyu;

otkroyte tayny stantsii i golosa II AYRIS;

naydite kollektsionnye predmety —nagradu dlya samykh vnimatelnykh igrokov;

pogruzites v neveroyatnuyu atmosferu retrofuturizma.

Mini Trains transport you in a cozy playroom with the best railways tabletop ever, packed with 40 different layouts. You will be challenged to build tracks in situations that constantly get more puzzling. 

Use your logic, imagination and engineering skills to safely lead the trains to their final destination. And of course, you get to sit in the driver’s cab and blow the whistle!

Enjoy these features:
● 40 levels, including 12 specials, that will progressively challenge your logical thinking;
● Multiple ways possible to build the tracks and solve the riddles;
● New mechanics regularly introduced such as tunnels, switches and turntables;
● Peaceful country landscapes with roaming animals and rustic buildings;
● Historical steam trains and their beloved whistles;
● Scoring system and collection of achievement trophies.

Zagadochnaya smert devyati russkikh puteshestvennikov, kotoraya privela k beschislennym, nepodtverzhdennym gipotezam. Igrok pogruzitsya v beskraynie peyzazhi negostepriimnogo Urala s zadachey vyyasnit, chto zhe na samom dele proizoshlo. V khode sobytiy vy mozhete stolknutsya s bolshim kolichestvom spekulyatsiy, chem ozhidalos...

Osobennosti:
* rasskazano Shonom Binom;
* opyt pogruzheniya v issledovaniya;
* ledyanaya atmosfera i napryazhenie;
* samodelnaya istoriya, vdokhnovlennaya istinnymi sobytiyami;
* nelineynyy otkrytyy mir;
* vnutriigrovaya navigatsiya po karte i kompasu;
* rabotaet na Unreal Engine 4;
* slozhnye issledovaniya;
* raschetnaya prodolzhitelnost igry: 4–6 ch

On a faraway planet Dobo is a worldly renowned hero. He’s inspired the work of millions of people.
But something very serious happened. Dobo has lost that sparkle in his eyes and, little by little, started to get stuck in his own thoughts, creating blockings, shutting himself in a dark room.
After a short time, Dobo didn’t seem the same anymore, but few could see him, because he set himself apart from everybody else.
Fortunately his family, especially his grandchildren, are making an effort to get him out of his dark room and bring him back to life.

- Online ranking for each mission;
- 45 missions;
- Challenging puzzles;
- Pixel art;
- End when completing the game.

American Hero — tak i ne vypushchennyy epatazhnyy i nezabyvaemyy interaktivnyy film, v kotorom vy igraete za zvezdu bezumnogo boevika iz 90-kh. Naydite kogo-nibud, kto posidit s detmi — ot etogo adrenalinovogo fontana intrig, shpionov, tryukov i perestrelok prosto tak ne otorvatsya.

Igrayte za Dzheka — krasavchika i ofitsera razvedki na pensii, kotorogo pryamo iz strip-kluba otpravlyayut borotsya s virusologom Kryugerom. Zlodey-uchenyy khochet zarazit neschastnykh zhiteley Los-Andzhelesa virusom i podchinit sebe ikh razum. Vragi popytayutsya ostanovit Dzheka, i tolko ego myshtsy, razum i sharm mogut ego spasti. Riskuyte, improviziruyte — i togda sumeete nayti i zashchitit edinstvennogo uchenogo, u kotorogo est protivoyadie ot biologicheskogo oruzhiya Kryugera.

American Hero — eto obnovlennaya versiya (remaster) interaktivnogo filma dlya Atari Jaguar CD, kotoryy 25 let nazad dolzhen byl potryasti osnovy zhanra, no v itoge okazalsya nedostupen shirokoy publike. V nyom sygrali professionalnye aktery, takie kak Timoti Bottoms (The Last Picture Show, Johnny Got His Gun), Deniel Robak (The Fugitive, Final Destination) i Musetta Vander (O Brother, Where Art Thou, Wild Wild West). A dlya remastera Timoti Bottoms zapisal ozvuchku dlya mysley Dzheka, kotorye prikhodyat emu v golovu na protyazhenii vsey igry.

My sdelali remaster s nulya, ispolzuya novuyu igrovuyu logiku, no sokhraniv ambitsii originala. V etoy versii iskhodnye videomaterialy dopolneny novoy ozvuchkoy ot Timoti Bottomsa — eto American Hero v luchshem i samom polnom vide.

V igre American Hero vy naydete:

• vzryvnoy i beskompromissnyy gollivudskiy boevik s perestrelkami, intrigami i diko smeshnymi shutkami;

• khitryy syuzhet so mnozhestvom povorotov i kontsovok — a upravlyat im budete vy;

• unikalnyy format interaktivnogo filma — eto kak film, tolko interaktivnyy;

• novuyu ozvuchku ot Timoti Bottomsa v roli Dzheka, zapisannuyu spetsialno dlya remastera.

Konets sveta tolko nachalsya i ne ostalos nikogo.
Mashiny vzyali verkh, i vasha edinstvennaya tsel eto nayti propavshuyu sestru v atmosfere retro-volny.
Srazhaytes i naydite put skvoz opasnost s pomoshchyu vashego shchita v etom yarkom mire pikselnoy grafiki.

2D art platformer s pikselnoy grafikoy, velikolepnoy animatsiey i tshchatelno produmannym refleksiv i defensiv igrovym protsessom, kotoryy nuzhno izuchit i osvoit;

Saundtrek, v kotorom klassicheskaya muzyka sochetaetsya s elektronikoy vosmidesyatykh, sozdavaya sovremennyy mif.

Yarkaya pikselnaya grafika so svetyashchimisya obektami i futuristicheskiy gorod, kotoryy byl razrushen apokalipsisom.

Idite po puti Asty, poka ona ishchet svoyu poteryannuyu sestru na ulitsakh Modigarda, goroda na grani kontsa sveta.
Issleduyte 4 oblasti, zapolnennye groznymi mashinami i epicheskimi bossami.

2D platformennyy igrovoy protsess, osnovannyy na ekshen;
9 urovney, polnykh srazheniy i golovolomok, kazhdyy s epicheskoy bitvoy s bossom;
Priyatnyy i dostupnyy igrovoy protsess, i upravlenie;
Yarkaya sintezatornaya muzyka i pikselnaya grafika;
5 chasov igrovogo protsessa, schitaya sekrety i kollektsionnye predmety.

Kompanii po ochistke zabroshennykh domov srochno trebuetsya okhotnik na privideniya. My otlichno delaem svoyu rabotu, no v etot raz na nashem puti vstali melkie, vrednye i soobrazitelnye prizraki. Kto-to dolzhen sumet s etim spravitsya. Kto, esli ne ty? Ty tochno spravishsya. 
Prizrakam slishkom nravyatsya ikh doma, i oni ne sdadutsya bez boya. Oni budut shvyryatsya predmetami, pytatsya otstraivat zhilishche i vsyacheski meshat tvoey produktivnoy rabote. A prizrak shaman… Pro nego ya luchshe promolchu, on voobshche sushchiy demon. 
Dlya vypolneniya zadachi tebe budet vydana novaya sverkhprochnaya platforma s usovershenstvovannoy kineticheskoy sharovoy sistemoy snosa. Soputstvuyushchaya dokumentatsiya prilagaetsya. I tam eshche… nu, v obshchem, tam est kontrakt, kotoryy obyazatelno nado vypolnit. 
Nash spetsialist uzhe na meste i vvedet tebya v kurs dela.
Esli korotko, tebya zhdet 3 raznoobraznykh mira, s unikalnymi domami i okruzheniem, 78 urovney vklyuchaya 3 sekretnykh, a takzhe 13 raznoobraznykh uluchshateley i ukhudshateley, inogda prevrashchayushchikh tvoyu platformu, v nastoyashchee oruzhie razrusheniya, a inogda v medlennuyu nepovorotlivuyu ulitku. 
Ispolzuy vsyu svoyu silu, snorovku, vnimatelnost i skorost reaktsii, chtoby pokazat nadoedlivym privedeniyam, kto v dome khozyain.  V nashem dele glavnoe ne morgat, i togda k tebe pridet pochet, uvazhenie i khoroshie rekomendatsii po rezultatam vypolnennoy raboty. 
Osobennosti igry:
-	Krutaya HD grafika;
-	Mnozhestvo spetseffektov;
-	3 Velikolepno narisovannykh mira; 
-	75 urovney + 3 sekretnykh;
-	Mnozhestvo predmetov dlya totalnogo razrusheniya;
-	Privideniya s kovarnym intellektom;
-	13 vidov bonusov;
-	Priyatnye vpechatleniya garantiruem.

Hyperforma — eto zakhvatyvayushchaya istoriya ob issledovatele, kotoryy v odinochku otpravlyaetsya v stranstvie po drevnemu kiberprostranstvu, ostavlennomu tainstvenno ischeznuvshey tsivilizatsiey proshlogo, v nadezhde raskryt sekrety ego poveliteley.

Vo vremya svoikh poiskov geroy stalkivaetsya s monumentalnymi «zhivymi» interfeysami, preodolevaet beschislennye prepyatstviya i vzlamyvaet samye izoshchryonnye sistemy zashchity, chtoby v konechnom itoge otkryt pravdu ne tolko o tragicheskikh sobytiyakh davno ushedshikh dney, no takzhe i o sebe samom.

Igrovoy protsess Hyperforma po svoey suti yavlyaetsya pereosmysleniem klassicheskoy arkady s elementami golovolomok, kotoryy podayotsya igroku v vide vzloma khitroumnykh virtualnykh zashchitnykh sistem.

Vas zhdyot uvlekatelnoe puteshestvie po nepodrazhaemomu miru, vdokhnovlyonnomu proizvedeniyami Uilyama Gibsona, Dena Simmonsa i Pitera Uottsa.

Osobennosti igry:
- atmosfernyy kiberpank setting;
- bolshoe raznoobrazie urovney i unikalnykh bossov;
- filosofskaya nauchno-fantasticheskaya istoriya;
- porazhayushchie voobrazhenie golovolomki;
- potryasayushchaya grafika i vizualnye effekty;
- vpechatlyayushchiy saundtrek.

Spetsialno dlya Nintendo Switch™ byla sozdana uluchshennaya versiya igry, kotoraya poluchila takie dopolnitelnye osobennosti:
- novyy rezhim protivostoyaniya dlya dvukh igrokov s ispolzovaniem razdelnykh kontrollerov Joy-Con;
- vozmozhnost upravleniya pri pomoshchi giroskopa;
- podderzhka HD vibratsii;
- polnostyu pererabotannyy interfeys i uluchshennaya tsvetokorrektsiya.

Path to Mnemosyne predlagaet vam otpravitsya v gipnoticheskoe priklyuchenie, postroennoe vokrug beskonechnogo priblizheniya mira. Sleduyte po puti, kotoryy vidite, issleduyte svoy razum i vosstanavlivayte zabytye vospominaniya, reshaya desyatki izobretatelnykh golovolomok.

Tainstvennaya istoriya, minimalistichnoe povestvovanie, volnuyushchie grafika i zvuki — vse eto delaet Path to Mnemosyne originalnym i zapominayushchimsya proektom, kotoryy ne ostavit ravnodushnym ni odnogo igroka.

Udastsya li vam doyti do kontsa puti?

Osobennosti igry:

porazitelnyy graficheskiy stil;
osobaya atmosfera, igrayushchaya s vashimi chuvstvami;
desyatki golovolomok;
prostoe upravlenie i slozhnye ispytaniya;
otkrytyy syuzhet.

這是一本互動漫畫，講述了20世紀最著名的事件之一。 關於1914年6月28日在薩拉熱窩發生的事情，有許多理論。 這是蓄意謀殺嗎？ 這是悲劇的意外嗎？ 這是共濟會陰謀嗎？
波斯尼亞塞族人加夫里洛·普林西普殺害了奧匈王位繼承人弗朗茨·斐迪南，正式引發了第一次世界大戰。 但他是誰，是什麼導致了這個行為？ 那弗朗茨·斐迪南呢？ 他是誰？ 弗朗茲是如何迎接那一天的？ 他們有什麼共同點，戰爭可以避免嗎？
在遊戲中，你會發現這些問題的答案，以及奧匈帝國雄偉的內部和巴爾幹半島的自然，由最偉大的漫畫藝術家之一Askold Akishin的筆下。

遊戲特色：
-可識別的Askold Akishin風格。 充滿活力的黑白漫畫面板圖案;
-一個完整的，令人興奮的故事;
-互動調查系統;
-測驗;
-來自不同藝術家的藝廊
還有更多！

在20世紀初踏上一段激動人心的旅程，看看第一次世界大戰的起源。
如果你不熟悉加夫里洛·普林西普和弗朗茨·斐迪南的歷史，這將是你一生中最令人興奮的歷史課。 如果你知道這些人的命運，那麼你將有一個獨特的沉浸在那個時代，你將能夠看到這些年的標誌性事件，並從不同的角度和細節來考慮這個驚人的故事。

FLATLAND - Vol. 2 is a fast-paced hardcore platformer featuring hand-crafted levels and Lightning-fast respawns. Help Square in crossing the most dangerous part of Flatland: the flooded wells.

Key features:

- Controls are simple and accessible but with several layers of depth to master;
- A lot of items to collect and new game modes to unlock;
- Lightning-fast respawns keep you in the flow even in more difficult levels;
- Challenging, fast and fun gameplay.

Glavnyy geroy igry terpit bedstvie na podvodnom sudne. Vinoy tomu okazyvaetsya gigantskiy krasnyy osminog, ego tsel - zagubit kak mozhno bolshe zhizney puteshestvennikov. No glavnyy geroy - Dayver - ne tak prost kak kazhetsya. On tvyordo nameren zapoluchit svoyu submarinu obratno i radi etogo gotov proyti po morskomu dnu i pogruzitsya v tyomnye glubiny peshcher, probiratsya skvoz gustye zarosli vodorosley i srazhatsya s nevedomymi dosele tvaryami.

V khode puteshestviya geroy uvidit mnozhestvo prekrasnykh peyzazhey i obretyot vernykh druzey, o chyom i budet krasochno rasskazyvat detyam... Esli, konechno, Vy pomozhete emu pobedit.

Osobennosti igry:
- Interesnaya, filosofskaya istoriya;
- Neobychnaya vizualnaya stilistika, napominayushchaya grafiku ZX Spectrum;
- Raznoobraznyy geympley, s neskolkimi vidami mekhanik i perekhodami mezhdu lokatsiyami.

Armies of undead, flying sharks and the price of immortality. Azuran Tales: Trials is a brutal platformer with RPG elements, challenging combat and merciless enemies. Journey across the World of Azuran as you discover its beautiful levels, expansive lore and unravel the mystery of Magrath. But don't expect an easy journey as you explore this world full of lore, monsters, traps, and unique bosses. This game is straightforward and hard to beat so you will be forced to learn and adapt or fail and die each and every time!

Fight to the death and beyond

Explore the secrets and mysteries of the world of Azuran. Face the trials put forward by Magrath, where death is never the end, just a moment of respite. For Drukandra will not let you find peace until the Amulet of Valur is remade and the balance is restored.

Discover the world of Azuran

Drukandra, the God of the Dead, Ruler of the Underworld, found your soul worthy for his quest. After granting you his blessing, you are sent to hunt down Magrath, an entity shrouded in mystery, who wields great power and wishes to claim the world of Azuran as his own. Only by finding the hidden pieces of the Amulet of Valur can you bring this foe down but doing so won't be easy. Deadly traps and villainous enemies await you for Magrath knows you are coming, and he will not make things easy for you!

Key Features:

• A modern take on the classic side-scrolling gameplay;
• Deadly gameplay: 15 handcrafted and increasingly difficult levels where you encounter deadly mechanics and increasingly powerful traps. Engage in nerve-shattering battles with split-second reaction speed. Face the trials and follow Magrath’s path in the world of Azuran and beyond;
• Discover the world of Azuran: explore vast, diverse environments – haunting dungeons, intricate caves, floating cities, cursed temples and all the dangers lurking within;
• Battle Cleric class gameplay and storyline: Evolve your character with powerful new abilities and spells with choice-based character progression. Gather and use powerful scrolls fitting your combat style. Follow Merius storyline and gather revealing lore about the world and its dangers;
• Fight to the death and beyond: brutal boss fights where you face ferocious beasts, sinister magic-wielders and defeat ancient threats on your path to completing the Amulet of Valur.

#RaceDieRun is an arcade racing game in which you pilot extremely fast ships. Easy controls meet a challenging gameplay in a #Race that perfectly executes the "easy to learn, hard to master" saying. You will #Die many times. But you will want to improve, repeat, #Run and gain a huge satisfaction from it. 

More than 30 types of traps await you - from simple moving blocks to leaps of faith and other creative obstacles to overcome. Every level will give you a different set of challenges to beat.  

You can always just give up and quit with rage. But you’re not that type, aren’t you? 

Features: 

- Fast-paced gameplay that will test your reflexes;
- 60 levels to finish with extra green caps to find and harder challenges to accomplish;
- 15 insane bonus levels which require ninja senses to beat; 
- Get the best time and compete with other players for the best position on leaderboards;
- Race with ghosts of your previous runs.

2145 god. Na Zemle prodolzhayut pylat pozhary. Zallagor poterpel porazhenie, a ego armiya razgromlena, no tsena okazalas slishkom vysoka: nekogda velikie goroda Zemli lezhat v ruinakh.

Chelovechestvo zhazhdet mesti. Byla obnaruzhena rodnaya planeta Zallagora — Zerkl. Da, sam Zallagor myortv, no emu na smenu mozhet priyti kto-nibud drugoy. Byt mozhet, eto uzhe proizoshlo. Destructivator gotov k boyu — prishlo vremya nanesti otvetnyy udar!

Vozmite na sebya rol kroshechnogo supersoldata v kostyume iz spandeksa tsveta layma! Preodoleyte vse lovushki i raschistite sebe put k pobede ognyom i kulakom, unichtozhaya vrazheskikh soldat, robotov, kosmicheskie korabli, bossov — i vsyo ostalnoe, chto budet vam meshat! Srazhaytes nalegke ili zakhvatite vrazheskiy korabl, chtoby smesti oboronu Zerkla i pokonchit s inoplanetnoy ugrozoy raz i navsegda.

OSOBENNOSTI:
– 6 epicheskikh zadaniy i bolee 50 neprostykh urovney;
– ogromnoe raznoobrazie vragov, kotorykh mozhno raznosit v klochya;
– mnozhestvo srazheniy s bossami i mini-bossami;
– vozmozhnost zakhvatyvat vrazheskie korabli i atakovat s vozdukha;
– vozmozhnost khodit v chudovishchnom kostyume tsveta layma;
– tri urovnya slozhnosti: obychnyy, vysokiy i koshmarnyy;
– old-skul ne proshchaet oshibok!

Cardful Planning — eto dinamichnaya golovolomka, gde vam v roli khrabroy igralnoy karty predstoit otpravitsya v polnoe priklyucheniy puteshestvie po opasnomu podzemelyu.

Udastsya li vam proyti bolee 100 urovney, vzyat verkh nad plokhim raskladom i spasti svoego kompanona?

Chetyre unikalnye sposobnosti mastey pomogut razgadat golovolomki i perekhitrit protivnikov, a naydennye modifikatory povysyat dostoinstvo vashey karty i pozvolyat pereyti na sleduyushchiy uroven podzemelya.

Vosmibitnaya grafika v stile retro i pyat zon s neprostymi ispytaniyami sozdayut nepovtorimuyu atmosferu Cardful Planning.

Osobennosti:

– 100 urovney v pyati raznykh zonakh;
– rezhimy dlya spokoynogo, skorostnogo i napryazhennogo prokhozhdeniya;
– chetyre sposobnosti mastey, kotorye mozhno razblokirovat i osvoit;
– setevaya tablitsa liderov;
– neobychnyy dizayn urovney;
– vosmibitnaya grafika v stile retro.

Ispolnyaya zakaz tainstvennogo Neizvestnogo, Vam neobkhodimo probratsya v bashnyu mogushchestvennoy kolduni Beatriche, pokhitit eyo knigu retseptov i vybratsya zhivym. 

Vam pridyotsya proniknut v son demona stuzhi i uznat ego sokrovennye zhelaniya, prinyat vyazanyy podarok ot babushki-pauchka, zapustit chasovuyu bashnyu, nakormit ulitku, napoit demona chaem, sobrat skelet, nakonets, peremestitsya vo vremeni, chtoby ispravit sobstvennuyu zhe fatalnuyu oploshnost.

Osobennosti:
- Shest etazhey – kazhdyy so svoey atmosferoy i nastroeniem.
- Udivitelnye i ocharovatelnye zhiltsy bashni: demony ognya, stuzhi i sna, zheleznaya deva, golodnyy sunduk i mnogie drugie;
- Zelevarenie! Retsepty prilagayutsya.
- Unikalnye golovolomki ot prostykh do mozgodrobitelnykh;
- Atmosfernyy saundtrek, pogruzhayushchiy v mir igry;
- Mnozhestvo otsylok k izvestneyshim igram, filmam i knigam – uznay ikh vse!

Armiya prisheltsev ukrala u plemeni nashikh geroev svyashchennyy artefakt. Podobnoe sluchilos i na drugikh planetakh. Beda v tom, chto bez sily etikh artefaktov solnechnoy sisteme grozit ugasanie.

Otpravlyaytes v dolgoe puteshestvie v poiskakh pravdy. Kakuyu tsel prisleduet vrazheskaya armiya, i smozhete li vy vernut artefakty ranshe, chem ischeznet vsya Vselennaya?
Ispytayte na sebe nastoyashchee platformennoe bezumie: vypolnyayte nevozmozhnye tryuki, igrayte vmeste s druzyami i gotovtes spasti vsekh i vsya!

Osnovnye vozmozhnosti:
• sovmestnyy rezhim s podderzhkoy do 4 igrokov;
• 4 personazha s unikalnymi sposobnostyami;
• otkrytaya dlya issledovaniya galaktika so mnozhestvom planet i obitateley;
• zlye bossy, kotorykh nuzhno pobedit;
• pikselnyy stil i igrovoy protsess v dukhe klassicheskikh igr;
• nastroyka personazhey i korablya;
• mini-igry – v tom chisle i protiv druzey v setevoy igre.

Na Zemle obnaruzhilas laboratoriya, v kotoroy prisheltsy provodyat eksperimenty. Znachit, pora sobrat komandu nayomnikov i unichtozhit zakhvatchikov strelboy, rukopashnym boem i bombardirovkami.
V etom vdokhnovlyonnom 8-bitnymi igrami i filmami 80-kh dvukhmernom platformere s klassicheskimi mekhanikami vam pridyotsya vzryvat vsyo vokrug, bitsya s prisheltsami i pobezhdat prichudlivykh bossov.

PERSONAZhI

 — Finn: kachok, byvshiy morpekh, byvshiy lyubitel gotovit na grile i byvshiy master po remontu televizorov;
 — Bekka, samaya opasnaya i samaya krutaya devchonka na etoy planete;
 — Teddi, bronirovannyy pyos (da, vy vsyo pravilno prochitali), kotoryy stal zhertvoy eksperimentov prisheltsev i teper khochet otomstit im, nu ili prosto nayti svoego khozyaina.

OSOBENNOSTI
 — Klassicheskie mekhaniki dvukhmernykh platformerov;
 — 8-bitnaya grafika i zvuk;
 — 3 dostupnykh personazha;
 — 4 vida oruzhiya dlya unichtozheniya vragov;
 — Razryvayte vragov na klochki oskolochnymi granatmi;
 — 7 etapov po 3 urovnya kazhdyy;
 — Epichnye bitvy s bossami!

This Slasher RPG takes you to a dark fantasy world where hordes of monsters now rule over a once prosperous land. Fight them with a dynamic and intuitive combat system and level up your skills to defeat all 10 levels and the final Dragon-boss.

There are various enemies, each requiring a different approach from you. Attribute your skill points to develop a personal build throughout the game. You can choose to become an unstoppable tank, a deadly archer or a powerful mage, or combine all of these aspects in a unique way.

Diabolic Features:
- Pixel art Slasher RPG perfect to take a fun break
- A good difficulty curve to get you quickly started but challenge you towards the end;
- Different types of enemies that make the combat varied and interesting;
- A simple yet decisive upgrade system, that you can reset to use your skill points differently, and that can let you play with totally different styles;
- A “hellish” dark fantasy world with atmospheric music.
